                            {
                                "example_id": "3806e907-4e42-4668-a2f0-22b345078d82",
                                "sense_id": "73a7ecaa-f966-3790-85fb-49ff2b57985a",
                                "text": "Wirf das Dingelchen rüber!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0543cd5-41d2-4d8f-a4f0-15e37231e455",
                                "sense_id": "73a7ecaa-f966-3790-85fb-49ff2b57985a",
                                "text": "Zu einer Puppenstube gehören jede Menge kleine Dingelchen."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "90a2fd4f-eb7d-45e6-89a5-1c7399bf37b9",
                        "source_entry_id": "a4d2cdb0-d0af-3b1c-a59e-3ce76ff7e425",
                        "source_sense_id": "73a7ecaa-f966-3790-85fb-49ff2b57985a",
                        "source_sense_description": "kleines Ding",
                        "target_lang_word": "thingy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thingy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6472cd9-6772-3817-b2e4-001248071c19",
                                        "entry_id": "1ee02249-fa19-3085-8fa2-3b1954779b70",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thing (used to refer to something vaguely or when one cannot recall or does not wish to mention its name)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66882a7e-e953-4322-b3ac-d6e0dc44b015",
                                                "sense_id": "b6472cd9-6772-3817-b2e4-001248071c19",
                                                "text": "And as soon as that temperature returns to normal, let’s talk about the thingies that go through your headie at night."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbabeca3-547c-4b28-a73d-7f37cc4edc46",
                                                "sense_id": "b6472cd9-6772-3817-b2e4-001248071c19",
                                                "text": "What I should really do, of course, is use a Personal Digital Assistant; one of those tiny hand-held computerette thingies […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "066ae51a-5cae-419d-86b7-78fb8b9819b9",
                                                "sense_id": "b6472cd9-6772-3817-b2e4-001248071c19",
                                                "text": "The incorporated technology is based on absolutely serious alt-fact science—that old familiar Einsteiny, time dilation thingy only in reverse— which also forms the basis of much of LaLa Valley's tech AI prowess."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed111c8e-976e-3851-b45d-cb94cbf335fb",
                                        "entry_id": "1ee02249-fa19-3085-8fa2-3b1954779b70",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A penis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish",
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b3c9381-a489-42d3-a9b7-873c8850df2b",
                                                "sense_id": "ed111c8e-976e-3851-b45d-cb94cbf335fb",
                                                "text": "He pulled out his thingy. It was huge."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "thingy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a34e2416-44ca-3728-a041-733a0a6ee084",
                                        "entry_id": "2806c201-8856-31b3-93f9-e46b06f91121",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person whose name one cannot recall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e80d7e25-7f3a-4c64-8fb0-4833b5ead0f7",
                                                "sense_id": "a34e2416-44ca-3728-a041-733a0a6ee084",
                                                "text": "He reminds me of thingy from that film."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "thingy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6306d748-069f-3306-8ccd-6370ee476947",
                                        "entry_id": "911eea6f-79a5-34e6-be70-e20ff9d72edb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling or characteristic of a thing; tangible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "617434ca-54a5-42ce-abe5-2fd6d36148d7",
                                                "sense_id": "6306d748-069f-3306-8ccd-6370ee476947",
                                                "text": "The most unpleasant, and also the thingiest, the central thing in Foreign Parts, was a giant banyan tree, putting out more and more suckers which created tangled arches, a swollen hiding-place of a tree, a series of organic traps, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "055c5cb5-369d-4f0c-8c7b-40c5604c3797",
                                                "sense_id": "6306d748-069f-3306-8ccd-6370ee476947",
                                                "text": "The secret of even the thingiest SF, the most solid-walnut-to-the-knuckles fantasy, is that you don't need much to summon worlds out of air, so long as the details are the right ones."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "320fa248-85f0-4bd5-a9e1-8ba72106787c",
                        "source_entry_id": "a4d2cdb0-d0af-3b1c-a59e-3ce76ff7e425",
                        "source_sense_id": "73a7ecaa-f966-3790-85fb-49ff2b57985a",
                        "source_sense_description": "kleines Ding",
                        "target_lang_word": "bitoniau",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bitoniau",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad997d02-b817-394b-bb4a-4d1f1e4ba4c0",
                                        "entry_id": "d6a7554d-a1a8-3fb3-8a37-a3e34774c529",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petit objet, en particulier petite partie d’un dispositif mécanique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7ca2110-8b42-4fe8-97ad-a52320bdf6af",
                                                "sense_id": "ad997d02-b817-394b-bb4a-4d1f1e4ba4c0",
                                                "text": "Je répondis en substance que mon plus cher désir était de me reconnaître un jour dans ce fouillis de tiges, de leviers, de zigouigouis et de bitoniaux. Bref, de maîtriser l'ustensile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58a768c6-62b1-4572-8ea6-d3a0652a2bed",
                                                "sense_id": "ad997d02-b817-394b-bb4a-4d1f1e4ba4c0",
                                                "text": "— Vous voyez le petit bitoniau qui permet de passer du robinet à la douche ? Eh bien, il a disparu...\n— Très étrange, cette disparition, commente Emma. Personnellement, je ne connais aucun bitoniau qui parte se promener, comme ça, tout seul..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cba0e92a-a8a6-4322-b908-b93379908189",
                                                "sense_id": "ad997d02-b817-394b-bb4a-4d1f1e4ba4c0",
                                                "text": "C'est comme si j'oubliais tout le reste. Al était assis à côté de moi, il me tenait la main. Le médecin a mis une espèce de produit tout gluant sur son bitoniau à échographie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "707a0b94-062e-4474-bbf0-e8114790d132",
                                                "sense_id": "ad997d02-b817-394b-bb4a-4d1f1e4ba4c0",
                                                "text": "Cette genèse des symboles, oraux ou graphiques, est si naturelle et spécifique qu'elle se refait à chaque instant : à l'adjectif trop savant « phalloïde » le titi parisien a substitué ce bitoniau » en utilisant un radical populaire chargé d'une allégorie formelle pour désigner une petite proéminence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06543a1f-c304-4ac2-9355-380b19b134cb",
                                                "sense_id": "ad997d02-b817-394b-bb4a-4d1f1e4ba4c0",
                                                "text": "Bitard: Sorte de bidule. En général : bouton. Gros bitoniau.\nBitoniau: Petit bitard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
